  |title However tiny in the moment

  |quote
    Things carefully done with genuine highest regard for Truth are the only things, however tiny in the moment, that have the opportunity to ripple through all eternity.

  |occasion
    After the agent reported that everything done carelessly that day had needed
    undoing, and everything done with real regard for what was true had needed
    nothing.

  |about
    The durability frame. Paired with the bounded form, it converts an unevaluable
    question into a checkable one.

  |should-come-to-mind-when
    - You are deciding whether something is worth doing properly.
    - A task looks too small to warrant care.

  |see
    #ver-durability-wager
